## Goal
Show how the six samples (A1-A3 untreated, B1-B3 treated) relate to one another by a principal
component analysis of the gene-level counts, with samples coloured by condition. The result is
a plot and the numbers behind it; what the separation (or lack of it) means is left to the reader.

